@PersonalProject_HostAddress = http://localhost:5026

### 1. Get All Schemes
GET {{PersonalProject_HostAddress}}/api/schemes
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Scheme by ID
GET {{PersonalProject_HostAddress}}/api/schemes/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create a New Scheme
POST {{PersonalProject_HostAddress}}/api/schemes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Need-Based Financial Aid",
  "description": "Financial assistance for students with demonstrated financial need.",
  "deadline": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "eligibilityID": 1
}

### 4. Test 404 (Non-existent ID)
GET {{PersonalProject_HostAddress}}/api/schemes/999
Accept: application/json


### Get Eligibility by ID (includes schemes)
GET {{PersonalProject_HostAddress}}/api/eligibility/1
Accept: application/json

### 1. Successful User Registration
POST {{PersonalProject_HostAddress}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ali Khan",
  "email": "ali.khan@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123"
}

### 2. Duplicate Registration Test (Returns 409 Conflict)
POST {{PersonalProject_HostAddress}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ali Khan",
  "email": "ali.khan@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123"
}

### 3. Invalid Email Format (Returns 400 Bad Request)
POST {{PersonalProject_HostAddress}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ali Khan",
  "email": "invalid-email-address",
  "password": "123"
}
###
GET {{PersonalProject_HostAddress}}/api/schemes/test-error
